    "title": "",
    "legend": "Abnormally high uptake in the right supraclavicular lymph node (yellow arrowhead) and right lower paratracheal lymph node (red arrowhead) is detected by PET. The right lower paratracheal lymph node is the primary lesion and is approximately 27&nbsp;mm in size. The right supraclavicular lymph node is the metastatic lesion and showed slight swelling.",
